        "answer": "Probably not as a permanent contract. Selection is an interaction state; focus is semantic attention. Selection may acquire focus by policy, but the concepts should remain distinguishable.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-question",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "idea-question",
          "sourceRef": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/idea-template/classes/nodes/idea-question.node-class.node"
